      "content": "thanks for that. u mentioned the middle east and asia helped with math and astronomy, but that felt a bit brief compared to the part about greeks and the renaissance. could u expand on those other cultures? like besides just math, what were their actual systems of law or government that helped shape things? i want to make sure i'm not leaving out the big ones.",
