      "content": "The focus on the West is often a reflection of the historical dominance of European powers in shaping the modern global order. While African and other civilizations were certainly complex, their achievements were often sidelined or categorized differently by the dominant Western historical narrative. These narratives tend to prioritize the lineage that directly led to the current political and scientific structures of Western nations. It's less about inherent value and more about whose story became the accepted mainstream curriculum.",
